# API Guidelines

## Architecture flow
`presentation/*.controller.ts` → `application/*.use-cases.ts` → `domain/*` → `infrastructure/*`

## Controllers — allowed
- Validation (DTOs + class-validator)
- Authentication / authorization guards
- Request/response mapping

## Controllers — forbidden
- Business logic
- Direct Prisma/database access

## REST standards
- Consistent error shape (see shared errors in API)
- Pagination, filtering, sorting where lists are exposed

## Error pattern
```json
{
  "code": "BUSINESS_RULE_VIOLATION",
  "message": "Description",
  "details": []
}
```

## Security
- OWASP Top 10 awareness
- Rate limiting (Throttler), input validation, secrets via env only
- Swagger disabled or restricted in production

## Realtime (chat)
- WebSocket events immutable, past-tense; idempotent handlers where applicable
